{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they shall flee from you.</b> From the weak among you, and not from the mighty among you (there)." "<b>Five of you shall pursue a hundred, and a hundred of you ten thousand.</b> But is this the reckoning? For it should have needed to say only: a hundred of you shall pursue two thousand! Rather, the few who do the Torah are not like the many who do the Torah (there)." "<b>And your enemies shall fall, etc.</b> That they shall fall before you not in the natural way (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:35.198316273Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}